  "text": "You are getting ready for a whole day walking through the old town. I chose a grey ribbed turtleneck sweater that feels cozy yet neat, paired with wide-legged jeans in a silvery tone that have a subtle brand print all over them. To complete the look, you have beige mesh sneakers for comfort on cobblestones and a deep emerald belt to define your waist perfectly. This outfit brings a cool, autumnal feel while staying put-together enough for a guided tour.",
  "how_to_wear": [
    "Tuck in your sweater slightly at the front if you want to emphasize the high-waisted jeans, or leave it untucked for a relaxed, effortless vibe as you wander.",
    "Let the wide belt hang naturally over the hips; it acts as a focal point and keeps your silhouette elongated while you walk."
  ],
